cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Student Physical Health RAG: Benchmark, Early Warning, and RAG-Bandit Recommendation"
abstract: >-
  A three-module system for student physical health: (1) benchmark of 16
  modern tabular models on a 9-class health-state labeling scheme (HI9),
  (2) cross-grade early degradation warning, and (3) RAG retrieval +
  contextual-bandit personalized intervention recommendation over a health
  knowledge base. Includes a LangGraph multi-agent demo (HealthAgent) with
  SFT/DPO-fine-tuned Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct.
authors:
  - name: "Project Contributors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/LLLLLZ-529/health-rag-student-fitness"
keywords:
  - "health RAG"
  - "student fitness"
  - "tabular models"
  - "early warning"
  - "contextual bandit"
  - "LangGraph"
  - "SFT"
  - "DPO"
